  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "オッケー！\r\n甘奈ちゃん、お疲れ様！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0328"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014018020010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nお疲れ様でした！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401802/2014018020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "……うーん……\r\nふふっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014018020020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうしました？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401802/2014018020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "いやね、甘奈ちゃん\r\n昔よりもぐっと魅力的になったなぁと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "自分の武器を使いこなしてるって言うのかしら\r\nぐっと大人な雰囲気になったわね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014018020030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへっ\r\nありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401802/2014018020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014018020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "昔からの私を知ってくれてる方からそう言われると\r\nすごく自信になります",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401802/2014018020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "もー、謙虚なんだから！\r\nそういうこと言われると、ご褒美あげたくなっちゃうわ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nですが、お気持ちだけで大丈夫ですよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014018020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうです。素敵に撮っていただいた上に\r\n何かしていただくなんて──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401802/2014018020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "──いいのよ！　……そうだ！\r\nこのお店の店長ね、私と懇意なのよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "ちょっとー！\r\nいいかしらー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0454"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00587",
